  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>p</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>q</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>r</mi></math> be three logical statements. Consider the compound statements<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />Then, which of the following is NOT true?</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "GG7hw",
      "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is True, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is True",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Ig0CD",
      "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is False, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is False",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ATvvj",
      "text": "If<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> &nbsp;is False, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is True",
      "isCorrect": true,
      "image": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Tz3uc",
      "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is False, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is False",
      "isCorrect": false,
      "image": null
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>:</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;is equivalent to&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>S</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math></p>",
